@host = http://localhost:5000
@contentType = application/json

### Variables
@courseId = 

###
### POST: Upload a SCORM course package
### Form fields:
###   - package: SCORM zip file (required)
###   - title: Display title (optional)
###   - description: Course description (optional)
POST {{host}}/api/courses
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=----WebKitFormBoundary7MA4YWxkTrZu0gW

------WebKitFormBoundary7MA4YWxkTrZu0gW
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="title"

Workplace Safety Training
------WebKitFormBoundary7MA4YWxkTrZu0gW
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="description"

SCORM 1.2 compliant workplace safety course
------WebKitFormBoundary7MA4YWxkTrZu0gW
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="package"; filename="course-package.zip"
Content-Type: application/zip

< ./sample-course.zip
------WebKitFormBoundary7MA4YWxkTrZu0gW--

###
### GET: List all courses with pagination
### Query parameters:
###   - status: Filter by status (uploaded, invalid, deleted) - optional
###   - page: Page number (default: 1)
###   - pageSize: Items per page (default: 25, max: 100)
GET {{host}}/api/courses?page=1&pageSize=25
Accept: application/json

###
### GET: List courses by status
GET {{host}}/api/courses?status=uploaded&page=1&pageSize=10
Accept: application/json

###
### GET: Get course details by ID
### Replace {courseId} with actual course ID from upload response
GET {{host}}/api/courses/2f79c7de-1af6-49b8-96ef-f9efa6541146
Accept: application/json

###
### DELETE: Delete a course
### Removes the course metadata and uploaded package file
DELETE {{host}}/api/courses/2f79c7de-1af6-49b8-96ef-f9efa6541146
Accept: application/json
